description = "Charge, then release: the moons' weight comes down where you're aiming (up to 18 m). Everything within 3 m takes up to 32 (most at the middle) and is knocked down. Even what's too heavy to move can be crushed. Stronger or weaker by the moons: strongest when Ilun is full or the Wanderer is dark."
